        "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] An anthropomorphic bunny in a white hazmat suit with navy gloves and boots, lunge-sprinting in place with a steady gait on a solid flat green screen, even studio lighting, no shadow. The camera holds a Static Shot at chest height for the whole clip; only the bunny moves. Every frame is crisp and sharp as if shot at a very high shutter speed, each limb and edge held in fine clean detail through every instant of the motion, deep depth of field front to back.\n\noverall_soundscape: soft fabric rustle and quick light boot steps, rhythmic with the sprint.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
