      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "widgets_values": [
        "## De-rope T2V -> PixelForge (blubs v1)\n\nFull one-queue flow: prompt -> baseline gen (25 steps) -> jerk oracle -> time smear -> v2v re-denoise (inject 0.70) -> exact recover -> Sprite Studio (Gentle key, 8 colors) -> GIF/sheet.\n\n1. Write your sprite prompt in BOTH MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo nodes (pass 1 + pass 2 - keep them identical, keep the sharpness clause).\n2. Seconds in the PrimitiveFloat node; canvas in Resolution Selector.\n3. Queue. Sprite lands in output/pixelforge/derope_t2v_sprite_*.\n\nKnobs: inject 0.50 = sharper/closer tracking; oracle q lower = more frames held (cost up, smear down). Speed stack matches n.json."
      ]
    }
